# Applies when the repo root is the build context (docker/java-service.Dockerfile, built with
# `-f docker/java-service.Dockerfile .`). Trims what gets sent to the Docker daemon to roughly what that Dockerfile
# actually copies (each module's target/*.jar), instead of the whole reactor build output and every checkout's dev
# tooling. frontend/ and proxy/ build with their own directory as context and keep their own .dockerignore.
.git
.idea
.claude
graphify-out
node_modules
frontend/node_modules
frontend/dist
proxy/node_modules
**/target/classes
**/target/test-classes
**/target/generated-sources
**/target/generated-test-sources
**/target/maven-archiver
**/target/maven-status
**/target/surefire-reports
**/*.log
